TITLE      Results of time-of-flight transmission measurements
            for natCu at a 50 m station of GELINA
AUTHOR     (A.Karakaxi, C.Paradela, G.Alaerts, M.Diakaki,
            G.Gkatis, J.Heyse, S.Kopecky, G.Noguere, A.Plompen,
