FACILITY   (LINAC,2ZZZGEL) GELINA
INC-SOURCE (PHOTO)
           . Nominal average beam energy:     100 MeV
           . Nominal average current:         50 uA
           . Repetition rate:                 400 Hz
           . Pulse width:                     1-2 ns
           . Primary neutron production target:
           .  Mercury cooled depleted uranium
           . Target nominal neutron production intensity:
                                             3.4E+13 /sec
           . Primary neutron source position in moderator:
              Above and below uranium target
           . Moderator:
              Two water filled Be-containers around U-target
           . Moderator dimension:
              2 x (14.6 cm x 21 cm x 3.9 cm)
           . Moderator density:               1 g/cm3
           . Moderator temperature:           Room temperature
           . Moderator-room decoupler:        None
           . Neutron beam diameter at sample: 22 mm
           . Overlap suppression:             10B overlap filter
           . Other fixed beam filters:        Co, Pb
SAMPLE     Natural metal
           . Chemical composition:
             - Cu (99.5 wt%) with traces of Mg, P, S, Mn, Fe, Ni,
               Zn, As, Se, Ag, Cd, Sn, Te, Pb and Bi (ID BAM6)
             - Cu (92.25(5) wt%), Sn (7.60(13) wt%), P(0.170(8) wt
               with traces of Ag, Fe, Mn, Ni, Pb and Zn, all below
               50 ppm (ID BAM 4)
             - Cu alloy with Zn (39 wt%) and Pb (3 wt%) (ID BAM5)
           . Sample composition:
             - 0.25019836(63) at/b (ID BAM 6)
             - 0.20248929(19) at/b (ID BAM 4)
             - 0.13776197(42) at/b (ID BAM 5)
           . Sample temperature:              20 deg-C
           . Sample mass:
             - 317.016(1) g (ID BAM6)
             - 276.735(1) g (ID BAM4)
             - 299.417(1) g (ID BAM5)
           . Geometrical shape:               cylinder
           . Surface dimension:
             - 1189.93(32) mm2 (ID BAM6)
             - 1189.50(12) mm2 (ID BAM4)
             - 1189.76(38) mm2 (ID BAM5)
           . Nominal thickness:
             - 29.86(1) mm (ID BAM6)
             - 26.07(1) mm (ID BAM4)
             - 29.90(1) mm (ID BAM5)
           . Containment description:         None
METHOD     (TOF)
           . Moderator centre-detector front distance: 47.670(8) m
           . Flight path direction:
              9 deg with respect to normal of the moderator face
              viewing the flight path
           . Time-of-flight binning:
            +--------------------------+
              Zone length    bin width
            ----------------------------
                 12288           1 ns
                 12288           2 ns
                  8192           8 ns
                  6144          16 ns
                  4096          32 ns
                  4096          64 ns
                  4096         128 ns
                  4096         512 ns
                  2048        1024 ns
            +--------------------------+
DETECTOR   (SCIN) Li-glass scintillator (152.4 mm diameter,
            6.35 mm thickness) in the beam
CORRECTION . Dead time (factor < 1.2)
           . Background subtraction (Black resonance technique)
           . Normalization 1.0000(25)
